[center][size=6][color=#93c47d][b]CSS Shared Assets v1.0.2[/b][/color][/size][/center]

[b]Changed[/b]
[list]
[*]Support shared animations and facial playback for Eve 1.5.1, Unholy Genessa 0.3.1 and Commander White 0.1.2.
[*]Keep shared animation support for tHorny Proxima 1.0.1 and retain compatibility with earlier supported outfit revisions.
[/list]

[b]Upgrading[/b]
[list]
[*]Close the game. Replace CSS_SharedAssets_P under MortalShell2/Content/Paks/~mods/ with this full package.
[*]Install CSS 1.0.2 and the matching outfit updates. Shared Assets is a separate companion download.
[/list]
